{"id": "DfCmhZSRrjw", "title": "Video by vedic_twist", "description": "Part 2: Ek raja ka tuta vachan, aur Pandav-Kaurav ke vansh ki shuruaat. Agli kahani ke liye follow karo.\n\nAdi Parva, adhyay 77 se 85. Kacha ke mana karne par Devayani ne shraap diya, aur Kacha ne palat kar shraap diya ki koi rishi-putra usse shaadi nahi karega.\n\nSharmishtha ne Devayani ko kuen mein dhakela, raja Yayati ne bachaya, aur Sharmishtha ko daasi banna pada. Devayani ki shaadi Yayati se hui, Shukracharya ki ek shart ke saath.\n\nYayati ne vachan toda. Shukracharya ne unhe budhape ka shraap diya. Paanch beton mein se sirf sabse chhote Puru ne apni jawani di.\n\nHazaar saal baad Yayati ne kaha, ichha bhog se nahi bujhti. Puru raja bane, aur unke vansh mein aage Kuru aaye. Wahi vansh jisme Pandav aur Kaurav janme.\n\nAnkahi Kahaniyan, Part 2. Part 1 profile par hai.\n\n#mahabharata #indianmythology #ankahikahaniyan", "channel": "vedic_twist", "uploader_id": "30248523911", "uploader": "Vedic twist | Mahabharata facts", "timestamp": 1793196220, "like_count": 10454, "comment_count": 35, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/150.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2669673226815087a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 64.824, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQNx9EIYGwGAz-n0OKl-jtyXwiR6OlCT_m09PpuVrosgJsdpVa0H7eiUUfwKKkBE4Fj0xEz6iUMPCJV5SvEr8ax95WZRoD__YdQW07A.mp4?_nc_cat=110&_nc_oc=Adr_TxmVCX6xrlHweLZWaX4KwUrLOzaIUQ4IfkAhWpFE-nimH3xXSuZwGN3t_TIhOTX6QH6AN5Js8duVgcbnuqdR&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=WL5telzO7MwQ7kNvwFbJisG&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=s7TTZIw